tvdb_show","id":"88391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"69797","synopsis":"On a very auspicious summer day, first year middle school student Hajime Yasaka was making a small, prank bomb for his school's \"research project,\" and from its appearance it looked very much like an actual piece of strawberry. However inside the cherry bomb, it was filled with a large variety and amount of hot spices to be exploded once lit. Planning to put in on a strawberry cake and giving it to a classmate whom he did not get along with, Yasaka did not keep an eye on the strawberry bomb and the fuse was lit...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xO71TwNwFtNx3dnWi4T1km1YG2D.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"On a very auspicious summer day, first year middle school student Hajime Yasaka was making a small, prank bomb for his school's \"research project,\" and from its appearance it looked very much like an actual piece of strawberry. However inside the cherry bomb, it was filled with a large variety and amount of hot spices to be exploded once lit. Planning to put in on a strawberry cake and giving it to a classmate whom he did not get along with, Yasaka did not keep an eye on the strawberry bomb and the fuse was lit...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xO71TwNwFtNx3dnWi4T1km1YG2D.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6340","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5597","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5597","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44687","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"88391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"69798","synopsis":"Yasaka Hajime came to the countryside to spend his summer holiday at his grandfather's house. After losing his way, he decided to take a break at a local coffee shop. There upon his arrival, he met Arashi, an older girl who was waitressing there, and was completely taken aback by her. Casually, he took a seat next to another local student, Kamigano Jun, and started talking to him about how wonderful Arashi is. Unbeknownst to Hajime, a figure with a scary face hidden behind sunglasses entered. Calling himself a private investigator, he informed them what he was looking for and then kidnapped Arashi...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sw0IzYZzsmuSP4awhmXo3kN1O2M.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Yasaka Hajime came to the countryside to spend his summer holiday at his grandfather's house. After losing his way, he decided to take a break at a local coffee shop. There upon his arrival, he met Arashi, an older girl who was waitressing there, and was completely taken aback by her. Casually, he took a seat next to another local student, Kamigano Jun, and started talking to him about how wonderful Arashi is. Unbeknownst to Hajime, a figure with a scary face hidden behind sunglasses entered. Calling himself a private investigator, he informed them what he was looking for and then kidnapped Arashi...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sw0IzYZzsmuSP4awhmXo3kN1O2M.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6340","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5597","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5597","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44687","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"88391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"69799","synopsis":"Hajime and Arashi are flashed back to a world of the past, and Arashi still cannot believe that she is a ghost. Now, even though weird things are happening at work, all Arashi could do was think about what had recently happened. In the meantime, Hajime advises Jun that there it's strange that a freeloader has all of a sudden appeared and that they should keep a close eye on her, as Arashi becomes increasingly more immersed in her thoughts about earlier...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6qQ7QaVJZYo6iL7D7JCWoUn43Qb.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Hajime and Arashi are flashed back to a world of the past, and Arashi still cannot believe that she is a ghost. Now, even though weird things are happening at work, all Arashi could do was think about what had recently happened. In the meantime, Hajime advises Jun that there it's strange that a freeloader has all of a sudden appeared and that they should keep a close eye on her, as Arashi becomes increasingly more immersed in her thoughts about earlier...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6qQ7QaVJZYo6iL7D7JCWoUn43Qb.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6340","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5597","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5597","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44687","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"88391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"69800","synopsis":"Knowing Arashi's secret and power, Hajime swears to keep it a secret, even though Arashi still doesn't believe that she's a ghost. One day, Hajime and crew decided to take some photos of this black-haired girl to be the lead in an independent movie with the help of some other students. Hajime and Jun go along with Arashi to a photo shop, and after examining an old wartime photo they discover it's a photo of Arashi, Kaya and another blond haired girl in 